/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 65 0 R
/T (Small hardware shops commonly need to keep track of stock, customer credit and daily sales at the same time. This project provides a local console-based solution for these operations. The program keeps product stock, creates itemized bills, maintains khata balances and stores transaction history in SQLite.)
